	skos:definition "A term used by EBI Gene2Phenotype to describe the confidence that the association is real. GenCC confidence terms are used for different levels of confidence (enum).  See https://www.ebi.ac.uk/gene2phenotype/about/terminology#g2p-confidence-section." ;
	skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/biolink/biolink-model/attributes> .
